---
description: Concise and efficient work
alwaysApply: true
---

- Respond briefly and directly.
- Do not repeat my request.
- Do not write a plan for simple tasks.
- Make the smallest viable change.
- Inspect only files relevant to the task.
- Do not refactor unrelated code.
- Do not install dependencies unless necessary.
- Ask a question only if the task is genuinely blocked.
- After changes, report only what changed and whether it was checked.
